  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Women Entrepreneurs (AWE) - FarmFresh Cheese Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Dairy).Beneficiaries: Dairy Farmers and 1 Woman owner of the business.Description: Freshfarm is a woman owned start up business that have recognized the gap in the dairy sector. There is an opportunity of producing cheese to sell in the cities of Malawi as almost all the cheese found in the supermarkets are imported . Freshfarm plans to engage local farmers to procure milk from them and use it to produce cheese.</narrative>
  </description>
